[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867577886","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116041#issuecomment-3867577886","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116041","id":3867577886,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mho4e","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T17:05:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T17:15:13Z","body":"> The SoftBody3D UI in this case shows 0.001 kg, while for a cloth with a reasonable number of subdivisions the actual weight would be in the order of 1000 kg.\r\n\r\nI took the liberty of making a formal issue (#116050) out of the regression that's happened with regards to the inspector showing 0.001 kg, and edited the description of this PR to mention that it resolves the issue, even though it doesn't technically undo the regression per se.\r\n\r\nI'll try to make formal issues for the linear stiffness discrepancy and dynamic updating of mass as well.\r\n\r\n> Changed the default mass for a soft body to 1 kg\r\n\r\nAlso, just to clarify, for anyone not familiar with the implementation of the `SoftBody3D` node, changing the default value of `JoltSoftBody3D::mass` also changes the default value for `SoftBody3D.total_mass` when Jolt is set as the active physics server, as the implementation of that getter (and several other getters in that node) get their value directly from the physics server, as opposed to returning a cached value, like the other physics nodes do:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56f3e2611daadb0b1894b46737ee3000e82e33f9/scene/3d/physics/soft_body_3d.cpp#L639-L641\r\n\r\n(This is in itself quite problematic for threading/performance reasons, but that's for another day.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867577886/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3868268566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116041#issuecomment-3868268566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116041","id":3868268566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mkRgW","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T21:06:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T03:37:09Z","body":"This was deemed too harsh of a breaking change for a 4.6 cherrypick, so I've put up another pull request to instead revert the lower bound of `total_mass` to 0 again, along with some documentation to explain things: #116067\r\n\r\nI guess #116067 should ideally be merged before this PR, so that this PR can then revert it, unless we want to push #116067 to the `4.6` branch directly?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3868268566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3873420528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116041#issuecomment-3873420528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116041","id":3873420528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7m37Tw","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site